{"id": 1342, "updated": "2026-10-14", "episodes": [{"n": 1, "t": "So The Flower Has Wilted", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3607/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3607/dub"}}, {"n": 2, "t": "As My Love First Came", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3608/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3608/dub"}}, {"n": 3, "t": "Feel Love Deepen", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3609/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3609/dub"}}, {"n": 4, "t": "To tell the people in the capital that I make for the islands", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3610/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3610/dub"}}, {"n": 5, "t": "Be as dear now, those were the good old days", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3611/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3611/dub"}}, {"n": 6, "t": "To set the Tatsuta River ablaze", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3612/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3612/dub"}}, {"n": 7, "t": "They all exchange hellos and goodbyes at the famous gates of Afusaka", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3613/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3613/dub"}}, {"n": 8, "t": "Which shines over Mount Mikasa", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3614/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3614/dub"}}, {"n": 9, "t": "My Only Thought", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3615/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3615/dub"}}, {"n": 10, "t": "Rain takes longer to dry", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3616/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3616/dub"}}, {"n": 11, "t": "I feel as though my body is on fire with Ibuki mugwort", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3617/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3617/dub"}}, {"n": 12, "t": "The only sign of summer", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3618/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3618/dub"}}, {"n": 13, "t": "In my dreams, I creep closer to you", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3619/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3619/dub"}}, {"n": 14, "t": "People would always ask if I was pining for someone", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3620/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3620/dub"}}, {"n": 15, "t": "No matter where I stand", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3621/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3621/dub"}}, {"n": 16, "t": "Wait for the Emperor&#39;s Return", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3622/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3622/dub"}}, {"n": 17, "t": "Gust of wind", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3623/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3623/dub"}}, {"n": 18, "t": "My fear is that you will forget", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3624/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3624/dub"}}, {"n": 19, "t": "I do not know where this love will take me", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3625/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3625/dub"}}, {"n": 20, "t": "The fall paddy shacks", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3626/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3626/dub"}}, {"n": 21, "t": "But its legacy continues to spread", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3627/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3627/dub"}}, {"n": 22, "t": "Long Last We Meet", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3628/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3628/dub"}}, {"n": 23, "t": "To see the beautiful cherry blossoms", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3629/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3629/dub"}}, {"n": 24, "t": "When I must hide...", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3630/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3630/dub"}}, {"n": 25, "t": "I can look up and see the snowy cap of Mt. Fuji", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3631/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/3631/dub"}}]}